      "result": {
        "reply_text": "You can lodge, categorize, and track your refund grievance related to the airline's flight cancellation online at the AirSewa portal or via the AirSewa mobile application provided by the Ministry of Civil Aviation, Government of India.\n\nKeep your flight ticket, booking reference, payment receipts, and copies of your written requests to the airline ready.\n\nSubmit your complaint online at https://airsewa.gov.in/ or through the AirSewa mobile application.\n\nIf you need further guidance or wish to use pre-litigation consumer helplines, you may also contact the National Consumer Helpline at https://consumerhelpline.gov.in/ or call the toll-free numbers 1915 or 1800-11-4000.\n\nSource: Ministry of Civil Aviation - AirSewa Portal, P AIRSEWA\nSource: Department of Consumer Affairs - National Consumer Helpline (NCH), H NCH\nSource: National Consumer Helpline Grievance Redressal Procedure, procedure 1\n\nWhat I could not verify:\n- amount_inr\n- purchase_date\n\nThis is legal information, not legal advice.",
